stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Scheduled
    Scheduled --> Boarding : 10 min before
    Boarding --> Departed : gangway up
    Departed --> Delayed : estimate over 2 min late
    Delayed --> Departed : back on time
    Departed --> Arrived
    Delayed --> Arrived
    Scheduled --> Cancelled : weather
    Arrived --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

    state Departed {
        [*] --> AtSea
        AtSea --> Approaching : within 1 nm
        Approaching --> [*]
    }
    note right of Cancelled
        Passengers are notified
        and offered the next sailing.
    end note
